'''Tomkip Towers'''<ref name="Who Else Knows?" /> was an apartment building<ref name="Ever Been" /> on [[Level 5124]]<ref name="Who Else Knows?" /> of the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. It contained a [[Axis network safehouse|safehouse]] that was used by [[Luthen Rael]]'s [[Axis network]].<ref name="Ever Been" /> [[Aurebesh]] signs by the entrance identified the name of the structure, with "TOMKIP" on one side of the door, and "TOWERS" on the other.<ref name="Who Else Knows?" />

